  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "でんきを　つくって　あしに　おくり\nはしりを　アシスト。　みっかみばん\nやすまず　はしれるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "만든 전기를 다리로 보내서\n달리는 것을 돕는다. 삼 일 밤낮을\n쉬지 않고 달릴 수 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會製造電能，並傳送到腳上\n作為奔跑時的輔助動力。\n能不眠不休地奔跑三天三夜。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il produit de l’électricité puis la transfère\ndans ses pattes pour mieux courir. Ainsi, il peut\nfoncer pendant trois jours et trois nuits.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es generiert Strom und lässt ihn zur Unterstützung\nbeim Rennen in seine Beine fließen. Dadurch\nkann es drei Tage und Nächte ohne Pause rennen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La electricidad que genera y envía a sus patas le\nayuda a desplazarse rápidamente. Puede correr\nsin descanso durante tres días y tres noches.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Trasferisce alle zampe l’elettricità che produce\nper aumentarne la resistenza. Può correre per\ntre giorni interi senza mai fermarsi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon generates electricity and channels\nit into its legs to keep them going strong.\nBoltund can run nonstop for three full days.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "電気を　つくって　脚に　送り\n走りを　アシスト。　三日三晩\n休まず　走れるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会制造电能，并传送到脚上\n作为奔跑时的辅助动力。\n可以不眠不休地奔跑三天三夜。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La electricidad que genera y envía a sus patas le\nayuda a desplazarse rápidamente. Puede correr\nsin descanso durante tres días y tres noches.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "でんきの　ちからで　きゃくりょくを\nぞうきょう。　トップスピードは\nじそく　９０キロを　かるく　こえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "전기의 힘으로 다릿심을\n강하게 키운다. 최고 속도는\n시속 90km를 가볍게 넘긴다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "電力增強了牠的腳力。\n當以最高速度奔跑時，\n時速可以輕易超過９０公里。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se sert de l’énergie électrique pour augmenter\nla puissance de ses membres.\nSa vitesse maximale dépasse de peu les 90 km/h.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit Elektrizität verstärkt es seine Beinkraft.\nSo erreicht es mit Leichtigkeit eine\nHöchstgeschwindigkeit von über 90 km/h.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La electricidad le confiere una enorme fuerza en\nlas patas. Su velocidad punta puede superar los\n90 km/h sin problema.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La potenza delle sue zampe aumenta grazie\nall’energia elettrica. Quando corre a tutta\nvelocità supera facilmente i 90 km/h.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It sends electricity through its legs to boost their\nstrength. Running at top speed, it easily breaks\n50 mph.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "電気の　力で　脚力を\n増強。　トップスピードは\n時速　９０キロを　軽く　超える。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "电力增强了它的脚力。\n当以最高速度奔跑时，\n时速可以轻易超过９０公里。",
